You have access to an infinite supply of explosives that can reduce the height of any mountain by 1 per explosion. The bomb can only be dropped in between consecutive mountains, hence both mountains will have their heights decrease by 1 per explosion. Determine the minimum number of explosions required to make mountain range A look exactiy like B, or return -1 if it's not possible.
 CONSTRAINTS .1<=M<=10^5
 .0<=Hi<= 10^9
